  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Com Guards field conventional infantry as a core component of their combined-arms formations, with Level I infantry units integrated into the same command structure alongside BattleMech, armor, and aerospace elements at every organizational level. Crewing ultra-light autocannon capable of double-rate fire, these gunners can pour out suppressive fire at ranges that keep them beyond effective return from most infantry weapons, though the rapid cycling risks jamming under sustained use.</p>"
